> f(x: u8) = 100/(x-3)
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u8, 0..255
  requires x - 3 != 0  (in 100/(x - 3))
  defined at 255 of 256 points
  defined for: 0..2, 4..255
  undefined e.g. at x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=3
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..100   (20 distinct values)
  values: 0..12, 14, 16, 20, 25, 33, 50, 100
  fits in u7
  undefined at 1 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> wrap f
wrap analysis of f:
  x - 3   (u8)
      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 3 points, e.g. x=0
      nsw fails: signed wrap at 3 points, e.g. x=128
  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 3 points, e.g. x=0
      exact for: 4..255
  over all 256 points of the domain
